<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91133" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>: 
			contr.
		 forms, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτεροῦσσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					733
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1019
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτεροῦντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ion</u>
					202
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτεροῦντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1000
				</span></i>
			:—<i>feathered, winged</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀϊστοί, ἰοί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.171
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.773
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέδιλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					220
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰετός, Πάγασος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				7(6).44
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κόρα</span>, of the Sphinx,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				508
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἵππος</span>, of
			Pegasus, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				202
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι π</span>., of the
			horses of the Sun, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				466
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραυνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					576
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <i>fluttering</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαισήϊα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.453
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				12.426
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
			esp. in 
				Ep.
			, in phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπεα πτερόεντα</span>
			<i>winged</i> words, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.201
			</span></i>,al.; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὕμνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					5(4).63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερόεντι τροχῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυγὰ πτερόεσσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1238
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.23
				</span></i>
			: applied by <i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i> to the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέττιξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2079.32
			</span></i>.</div>
